    "market_commentary": "At 9,337 points, the SSY Pacific Capesize Index is at its highest point since November 2021, up by 1,264 points from 3 May. The W.AustraliaChina iron ore spot voyage rate climbed $1.25/t to $13.20/t, while there was a $5,250/day rise in the round-voyage rate to $27,750/day.",
